title: openWB: Chargepoint status
agents: openwb
catalog: hw/other
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk

description:
 This check monitors an individual chargepoint of an openWB wallbox
 controller. It reports fault state, plug/charge state, connected vehicle,
 charge mode, charging power, vehicle state of charge and total/daily
 energy charged.

 Data is collected via the special agent {agent_openwb}, which polls the
 read-only openWB simpleAPI HTTP endpoint
 ({/openWB/simpleAPI/simpleapi.php}) and auto-discovers configured
 chargepoints by probing a range of numeric IDs.

item:
 The chargepoint ID as reported by the openWB simpleAPI.

discovery:
 One service is created per chargepoint ID that the agent discovers.

params:
 The rule "openWB chargepoint power" allows configuring upper WARN/CRIT
 levels for the charging power.
